  "observation": "The CPU Normalized callback computes Float32(data_offset+texel)+0.5 then divides componentwise by Float32(display_size). Installed callback address 0x100cce048..0x100cce0e0 has fadd.2s then fdiv.2s; no reciprocal multiply substitution. The private consumer proposal restricts offset zero and data/display extents equal physical full-frame extents."
